      <h1>Property management for owners who care about what they actually keep</h1>
      <p class="owner-hero-lead">Seascape's current Gulf Coast portfolio runs at $1.4M in annual rental revenue with $119,923 already captured directly in direct bookings. We use that benchmark to show how management fees, booking channels, pricing, and day-to-day execution affect what an owner actually keeps.</p>
      <div class="owner-hero-actions">
