      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="owner-hero-panel">
      <span class="owner-panel-label">Benchmark + Teardown</span>
      <h2>What to look at before you change managers</h2>
      <p>Marketplace fees, expensive booking channels, review-risk signals, and uneven owner communication rarely show up clearly in an owner statement. The teardown shows what the current setup is still protecting, where costs are building up, and whether a switch is worth the disruption.</p>
      <ul class="owner-panel-list">
        <li><span class="owner-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Where premium nights are getting discounted too quickly or shifted into costly third-party channels</span></li>
        <li><span class="owner-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Whether the current manager is protecting owner margin or mostly reporting activity</span></li>
        <li><span class="owner-check" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Whether review risk, maintenance misses, or weak owner updates are weakening future rates</span></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

